{
  "song_id": 52158,
  "title": "Halo",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    1653,
    423220,
    498
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Remember those walls I built?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Well, baby, they're tumblin' down",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And they didn't even put up a fight",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "They didn't even make a sound",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I found a way to let you in",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But I never really had a doubt",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Standing in the light of your halo",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I got my angel now",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's like I've been awakened",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Every rule, I had you breakin'",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It's the risk that I'm takin'",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I ain't ever gonna shut you out",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Everywhere I'm looking now",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm surrounded by your embrace",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Baby, I can see your halo",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You know you're my saving grace",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You're everything I need and more",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It's written all over your face",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Baby, I can feel your halo",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Pray it won't fade away",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "post-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I can feel your halo, halo, halo",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I can see your halo, halo, halo",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I can feel your halo, halo, halo",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I can see your halo, halo, halo, ooh",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Hit me like a ray of sun",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Burning through my darkest night",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You're the only one that I want",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Think I'm addicted to your light",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I swore I'd never fall again",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But this don't even feel like falling",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Gravity can't begin",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "To pull me back to the ground again",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
